        {
          "nodeId": "n_s24_mia",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "食堂门口。她没躲别人的目光。露肩被日光碰到。她还是拉着你的手。",
          "assetId": "assets/scenes/ch04/S24-mia.webp",
          "artStatus": "ready",
          "camera": "hold",
          "transition": "fade",
          "fx": "warm-veil",
          "characters": [
            "kai",
            "mia"
          ],
          "artCue": "S24 半公开：Mia 接住旧名，不是安慰奖",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "mia",
              "text": "「笨蛋。叫我一声。」",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "这一声她接住了。指节还热。",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            }
          ],
          "advance": "n_s24_tail",
          "setFlags": {
            "ending": "end_mia"
          }
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "n_s24_jade",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "合影位不空。她把你拉进框。闪光开着。裙边还在抖。",
          "assetId": "assets/scenes/ch04/S24-jade.webp",
          "artStatus": "ready",
          "camera": "hold",
          "transition": "fade",
          "fx": "warm-veil",
          "characters": [
            "kai",
            "jade"
          ],
          "artCue": "S24 进框：Jade 故意留他",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "jade",
              "text": "「这下他们看清楚了。」",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "浅。真。她没松那只袖。",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            }
          ],
          "advance": "n_s24_tail",
          "setFlags": {
            "ending": "end_jade"
          }
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "n_s24_vanessa",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "檐下。地面是干的。雨已经下过了。风衣还潮。皮肤发凉，呼吸却热。",
          "assetId": "assets/scenes/ch04/S24-vanessa.webp",
          "artStatus": "ready",
          "camera": "hold",
          "transition": "fade",
          "fx": "vignette",
          "characters": [
            "kai",
            "vanessa"
          ],
          "artCue": "S24 裂缝：干檐，非雨吻，非女友DLC",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "vanessa",
              "text": "「我没倒向你。——还没。等、先别靠近。……哈啊……」",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "裂了。Troy 的影还在。唇还近。不是抢成。",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            }
          ],
          "advance": "n_s24_tail",
          "setFlags": {
            "ending": "end_vanessa"
          }
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "n_s24_crash",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "楼道空着。群还在转那两张图。",
          "assetId": "assets/scenes/ch04/S24-crash.webp",
          "artStatus": "ready",
          "camera": "hold",
          "transition": "fade",
          "fx": "vignette",
          "characters": [
            "kai"
          ],
          "artCue": "S24 翻车：空楼道，Troy 赢这一轮",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "这一轮 Troy 赢了。第一部仍完。……手机亮着，你没接。",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            }
          ],
          "advance": "n_s24_tail",
          "setFlags": {
            "ending": "end_crash"
          }
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "n_s24_rae",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "对门从里面关上。咔。水手领还没干。世界在门外。",
          "assetId": "assets/scenes/ch04/S24-rae.webp",
          "artStatus": "ready",
          "camera": "hold",
          "transition": "fade",
          "fx": "warm-veil",
          "characters": [
            "kai",
            "rae"
          ],
          "artCue": "S24 从里面关：世界在门外",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "rae",
              "text": "「隔墙听不见了。……唔……！」",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "她背对着你带上门。指节还贴着那层领。呼吸比锁轻。♥",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            }
          ],
          "advance": "n_s24_tail",
          "setFlags": {
            "ending": "end_rae"
          }
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "n_s24_lina",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "那天夜里。池面一条灯。大门从里面顶上。水声贴着小腿。膝盖不容拒绝地往前。",
          "assetId": "assets/scenes/ch04/S24-lina.webp",
          "artStatus": "ready",
          "camera": "hold",
          "transition": "fade",
          "fx": "warm-veil",
          "characters": [
            "kai",
            "lina"
          ],
          "artCue": "S24 该锁的楼：夜水，不给称呼",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "lina",
              "text": "「水不会等。今晚它等了。手别松开。……哈啊……」",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "她还是不给称呼。楼是锁的。泳衣贴着呼吸。链子在门里发烫～",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            }
          ],
          "advance": "n_s24_tail",
          "setFlags": {
            "ending": "end_lina"
          }
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "n_s24_reina",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "几天后，她又把你叫回教員室。打印的拼贴还在桌上。她把门打开。",
          "assetId": "assets/scenes/ch04/S24-reina.webp",
          "artStatus": "ready",
          "camera": "hold",
          "transition": "fade",
          "fx": "vignette",
          "characters": [
            "kai",
            "reina"
          ],
          "artCue": "S24 还是我的问题：送出办公室，未完成",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "reina",
              "text": "「出去。我还是你的讲师。——那天那一下，当没发生。等、先出去。」",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "她仍是问题。问题没有写完。黑丝还压在桌沿。门开着。嘴却偏开了。呼吸还乱。",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            }
          ],
          "advance": "n_s24_tail",
          "setFlags": {
            "ending": "end_reina"
          }
        },
